    - target: {fileID: 6226889290952283097, guid: ad9e39e63f8245e0b600864885c9eaf8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 'The Road System also holds a single Spline Path component on it. This
        is applied to all intersections and road pieces, controlling how the terrain
        is modified by the roads.


        You can have an individual road segment
        opt out of this behavior if you want, which can be useful for things like
        bridges.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
