    - target: {fileID: 6226889290952283097, guid: ad9e39e63f8245e0b600864885c9eaf8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "Roads are created from Intersections. Placing an intersection allows
        you to create roads off of it, which are spline based. \n\nIntersections
        and Roads are created under a RoadSystem, which allows you to set global
        options on everything below it. \n\nIn this demo, the data is generated on
        load. This keeps the file size smaller but makes startup times longer."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
